      "slides": [
        {
          "mediaUrl": "/images/defaults/mid-module-a-use-case.png",
          "mediaKind": "image",
          "text": {
            "en": "Park at racks, poles, or communal stands without fumbling for keys. Matte black body, recessed fingerprint pad, and a sleeved chain read as premium gear—because your lock should look as intentional as your bike.",
            "zh": "在停车架、立柱或小区车棚快速落锁，告别掏钥匙。哑光黑锁体、内凹式指纹区与织物包覆链条，与高端公路车气质一致——锁具本身也应是装备的一部分。"
